/**
 * Query-local structural key for learned operator feedback.
 * <p>
 * The structural fingerprint is an exact serialisation of the operator tree under one shared variable-ordinal
 * assignment: equal fingerprints imply isomorphic trees (modulo the deliberate constant abstraction of
 * {@link ConstantMode#PREDICATE_AND_CONTEXT_EXACT}). Order-independence of the fingerprint (join factor order, union
 * branch order, VALUES row order) is a hit-rate optimisation that is never obtained by dropping variable linkage or
 * operator parameters, so two different operators can never share a learning key.
 */
